<title>USA: Noble Drilling Corp Q4 profit rose sharply.</title>
<headline>Noble Drilling Corp Q4 profit rose sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.20   profit	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net profit		26,437   profit	 4,277</p>
<p> Revs		     141,738		   84,235</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 124,809		   95,432</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.66     loss	 $0.08</p>
<p> Net profit		78,637   profit	 1,594</p>
<p> Revs		     514,253		  327,968</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 110,252		   89,736</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Per share after preferred dividends of $1,511,000 in both quarters and $6,040,000 vs $7,199,000 in year.</p>
<p>1996 net includes gains of $17.4 million in quarter and $17.3 million in year from asset sales. Q4 net also includes charge of $660,000, equal to $300,000 after taxes for purchase of notes.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
